    "description": "Quartz morphs, commonly called Q-morphs, are the primary shell design used for Venusian surface mining. Constructed from quartz and extremely durable alloys, Q-morphs look squat, four-legged crabs with two pairs of arms. The lower pair of arms is designed for strength, the upper pair for precision and dexterity. This morph is exceptionally tough and capable of handling Venus's intense surface conditions. Behavioral mods help keep the workers sleeved in these morphs content with their grueling existence.",
